- Bundled validator: `101 hinted elements across 73 files — 0 errors, 0 warnings, 0 info`
- `npm run lint`: only pre-existing errors/warnings in untouched files
- `npm run build`: succeeded, only pre-existing warnings
- `npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json`: passed, no type errors
- `node_modules`/`dist` cleaned up afterward since they weren't present originally

